# CORTEX VIDEO: UNDO (ENV) puts back a knob's gesture, a look, a setting from the mirror; SEL + SELECT jumps a group;
# the mirror's commands: a setting (3), a scene (4), undo (5), a look (6)
wait 500
expect par0 5
spin K1 2
expect par0 7
tap ENV
expect par0 5
spin PRESET 1
expect look 1
expect par0 4
tap ENV
expect par0 5
sysex F0 7D 43 56 10 00 01 F7
sysex F0 7D 43 56 10 00 03 00 02 00 F7
expect par0 2
sysex F0 7D 43 56 10 00 05 F7
expect par0 5
press SEL
key 0 down
key 0 up
release SEL
sysex F0 7D 43 56 10 00 03 00 08 00 F7
expect par0 8
sysex F0 7D 43 56 10 00 04 00 F7
expect par0 5
sysex F0 7D 43 56 10 00 06 02 F7
expect look 2
expect par0 8
press SEL
turn ALGO 1
release SEL
expect page 3
press SEL
turn ALGO 1
release SEL
expect page 11
press SEL
turn ALGO -2
release SEL
expect page 0
press SEL
turn SELECT 2
release SEL
expect page 2
tap HOME
expect page 0
tap HOME
expect page 2
turn SELECT -2
expect page 0
spin K1 3
expect par0 10
press GLO
spin K1 1
release GLO
expect par0 5
spin K3 10
expect par2 90
press SEL
spin K3 3
release SEL
expect par2 93
shot ui.png
